## Building a Card Deck

### Card Types

```xiom
enum Suit {
  Hearts; Diamonds; Clubs; Spades;
}

enum Rank {
  Ace; Two; Three; Four; Five; Six; Seven; Eight;
  Nine; Ten; Jack; Queen; King;
}

type Card {
  suit: Suit;
  rank: Rank;
}
```

### Creating a Full Deck

```xiom
fn create_deck() -> Vec[Card] {
  let mut deck: Vec[Card] = Vec[Card].new();
  let suits: Vec[Suit] = Vec[Suit].new();
  suits.push(Suit.Hearts); suits.push(Suit.Diamonds);
  suits.push(Suit.Clubs); suits.push(Suit.Spades);

  let mut s = 0;
  while s < 4 {
    let mut r = 0;
    while r < 13 {
      deck.push(Card{ suit: suits.get(s).unwrap(), rank: rank_from_int(r) });
      r += 1;
    };
    s += 1;
  };
  deck
}
```

### Fisher-Yates Shuffle

```xiom
fn shuffle_deck(deck: &mut Vec[Card], seed: &mut Int) {
  let mut i = deck.len();
  while i > 1 {
    i -= 1;
    seed = (seed * 1103515245 + 12345) % 2147483648;
    let j = seed % (i + 1);
    let card_i = deck.get(i).unwrap().clone();
    let card_j = deck.get(j).unwrap().clone();
    deck.set(i, card_j);
    deck.set(j, card_i);
  };
}
```

### Dealing Cards

```xiom
fn deal(deck: &mut Vec[Card], count: Int) -> Vec[Card] {
  let mut hand: Vec[Card] = Vec[Card].new();
  let mut i = 0;
  while i < count && deck.len() > 0 {
    let last = deck.len() - 1;
    hand.push(deck.get(last).unwrap().clone());
    deck.remove(last);
    i += 1;
  };
  hand
}
```

